e_id":"80f8a64e-b22e-413e-a143-f1943be3a574","published_at":"2017-02-09","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"Glimmerdust Nap can target only a tapped creature.","oracle_id":"8b476e35-77df-4332-b29d-8bf6f1bbbc3e","published_at":"2007-10-01","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"If the enchanted creature becomes untapped, Glimmerdust Nap is put into its owner’s graveyard as a state-based action.","oracle_id":"8b476e35-77df-4332-b29d-8bf6f1bbbc3e","published_at":"2007-10-01","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"If the targeted creature has become untapped by the time Glimmerdust Nap would resolve, Glimmerdust Nap doesn’t resolve for having an illegal target.","oracle_id":"8b476e35-77df-4332-b29d-8bf6f1bbbc3e","published_at":"2007-10-01","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"If the enchanted creature stops being red or green, or if it stops being a creature, Encase in Ice will be put into its owner's graveyard.","oracle_id":"a61277d6-a27d-45d1-ba2a-7afe1b8f5ce1","published_at":"2015-02-25","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"The creature can still be untapped by other spells and abilities.","oracle_id":"a61277d6-a27d-45d1-ba2a-7afe1b8f5ce1","published_at":"2015-02-25","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"Coma Veil may target and may enchant an untapped artifact or creature.","oracle_id":"c062bd12-34cf-4177-92d4-8ce91206989d","published_at":"2008-10-01","source":"wotc"}],"schema_version":1,"source":"Scryfall Oracle/rulings subset for offline tests"}
